    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_9Kzg3KA9F3QnEFM",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID35",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "faithfulness_card_07d6f8ad179827507ec2514c__deepseek_deepseek-v4_1-flash-1017",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Paragraph</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">5. SURVEYS AND ADMINISTRATIVE DATA SOURCES (1–2 pages) &gt; Cyber harassment\n\nComponents:\n\nUnwanted sexually explicit emails or text (or online) messages;\n Inappropriate or offensive advances on social networking websites or internet chat rooms;\n Threats of physical and/or sexual violence by email or text (or online) message;\n Hate speech, meaning language that denigrates, insults, threatens or targets an individual based on her identity (gender) and other traits (e.g. sexual orientation or disability).\n\nSub-components:\n\nUse of force (use of threats / abuse of vulnerability, power, trust)\n Perpetrated by someone belonging to the intimate sphere (spouse, cohabiting partner, non-cohabiting partner, former spouse, ex partner, parents, between spouses or people who live together or have lived together, another member of the family, children, relatives, within the family or domestic unit, in her own home)</div><br><strong>Argument</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Cyber harassment includes threats of physical and/or sexual violence delivered by email, text, or online message. It also includes hate speech, meaning language that denigrates, insults, threatens, or targets an individual because of her gender and other traits. These threats can involve use of force through threats or abuse of vulnerability, power, or trust, and can be perpetrated by someone in the intimate sphere, including a spouse, partner, former partner, family member, or someone within the domestic unit or home.</div><br><strong>How relevant is the argument to the paragraph?</strong>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "faithfulness_card_07d6f8ad179827507ec2514c__deepseek_deepseek-v4_1-flash-1017",
