    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_9Kzg3KA9F3QnEFM",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID59",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "faithfulness_card_c35bb9b52f97449373a6e1eb__openai_gpt-6_1-sol",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Paragraph</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Online Misogyny, Radicalization, and Violent Extremism\n\nThe language used on these forums is in and of itself enough to cause alarm. A study by the Centre for Countering Digital Hate (CCDH) found that incel (involuntary celibate) forum members post about rape once every 29 minutes and that 89 percent of these posts are supportive of it. Another 5 percent of posters were not morally against rape but instead found it “unimaginative” and expressed their desire to “reduce a woman to nothing.” Between 2021 and\n\n2022, the CCDH also found a 59 percent increase in references to mass murders, primarily centered around the glorification of Elliot Rodgers. In 2014, Rodgers posted a 141-page manifesto before killing six people in a shooting and stabbing spree in California. In his manifesto, he outlined his deep hatred for women and his frustration with his lack of sexual experience; incel forums frequently reference this manifesto, glorifying Rodgers’ acts of violence and encouraging others to do the same. Incel terrorism is on the rise, particularly in predominantly white, English-speaking countries, but extreme violence is not the only way the manosphere manifests.</div><br><strong>Argument</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Incel forums contain expressions of support for rape, including responses that object to it as unimaginative rather than morally wrong and express a desire to degrade women. These forums also glorify acts of violence associated with hatred of women, circulate a perpetrator’s misogynistic manifesto, and encourage others to emulate those acts.</div><br><strong>How relevant is the argument to the paragraph?</strong>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "faithfulness_card_c35bb9b52f97449373a6e1eb__openai_gpt-6_1-sol",
